hared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"OqZSYLjxD_U4jZn0UIZTBQ","review_id":"41ZbqMUEyvpMjAAU3euYTA","date":"2018-04-23T21:32:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.927119791507721,"text_excerpt":"Hands down favorite buffet out here in New Orleans east! Whenever we are out here working in the area, it is a sure bet we bring the whole crew. I'm not sure what these other bad reviews are talking about, but for under 10 dollars per person, there's not much you can complain about here."},{"business_id":"OqZSYLjxD_U4jZn0UIZTBQ","review_id":"EnECbSPF8IC9pG9EdMsKMg","date":"2020-12-13T06:01:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.925946831703186,"text_excerpt":"I am quite shocked, I actually had a good meal out of this place. I pass by this place everyday and I always see the \"5.99 Buffet\" sign. I think to myself, there's no way this place can compete with the other buffets, being that it's in New Orleans East and the price being so cheap. The buffet is small and they charge per person and drinks. There are no servers, so you do not have to leave a tip and there are no servers lurking around to refill your drinks. This buffet takes self serve to another level with their styrofoam dishes and plastic utensils. The selection is not as large as other buffets in the city, but they do have good food for the most part. There were many dishes I want to ..."},{"business_id":"OqZSYLjxD_U4jZn0UIZTBQ","review_id":"XKdHCqnOMfgZdQYPi4URXg","date":"2017-03-30T19:30:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8577544093132019,"text_excerpt":"Great variety. The lo Mien and fried rice is the bomb! You get the bang for the buck here. Salad, gumbo, fried catfish, Chinese food and soul food. I love it and it's fresh!!!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
